{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（20日）早上近9時，淺水灣泳灘一名女子被職員發現倒臥泳灘上，昏迷不醒。救援人員接報到場，將事主送往律敦治醫院搶救。</p><p>警方正調查事主身份及事件經過，案件列作「有人暈倒」。</p><figure><img alt=\"淺水灣泳灘一名女子被倒臥沙灘上昏迷不醒。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200404162081329152147982.jpeg/bRS7N_S_6FnnYW11XRFn3NZVloVTgSrIQgo1w0IKNcM\"/><figcaption>淺水灣泳灘一名女子被倒臥沙灘上昏迷不醒。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200404169660829696726345.jpeg/pkWgOqOlwOAIk3xD3ziDhlzDcyJACDrmWfs4a1n7OGs\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為淺水灣泳灘。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200404159442980864371946.jpeg/DuVO_fdfBpSeVc5pLl88AzBD1lwttWh20KZzENCmcxA\"/><figcaption>現場為淺水灣泳灘。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200404167190253568927340.jpeg/dJVSjbIz8ZTiGwVZ9v1xl83tlt0FoEWRKDUUJSg1FCU\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200404164728066048954370.jpeg/Ol_4IOylh67eANhsAF1EjeUm_VgqpuX7QfSdHUH0nR0\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T03:24:02.115202+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:14:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T03:17:24.746298+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T03:17:24.746298+00:00","content_hash":"c083e670d9c72dfff25f465aba1744ecbb09603eeec1544c774ec05446d9c3c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}